Installation
============

Prerequisites:
  - meson >= 0.64
  - ninja
  - gtk4 development libraries (libgtk-4-dev)
  - cairo development libraries (libcairo2-dev)
  - librsvg-2.0 development libraries (librsvg2-dev)
  - x11 development libraries (libx11-dev)
  - pkg-config

Build and install:

  meson setup builddir --prefix=/usr/local --wipe
  meson compile -C builddir
  sudo meson install -C builddir

To install to a user-local prefix (~/.local):

  meson setup builddir --prefix=$HOME/.local --wipe
  meson compile -C builddir
  meson install -C builddir

To uninstall:

  meson uninstall -C builddir
